f-86c2-c6752aca4366" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-aaf67487-7df9-4a0d-9865-99617a6f220c" facs="#m-ac9dbdc3-b4fb-4f7c-bdea-102b9e911904" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Díxit Dóminus. 8. G. p. 133. — 2. Confitébor. 8. C. p. 140.</l><l xml:id="m-b46179d3-3300-492d-9fbd-ca753652a3de" facs="#m-60251fdc-282d-4926-9fdc-6a6a96a29eae" label="lyrics-like">— 3. Beátus vir. 7. a. p. 146. — 4. Laudáte púeri. 3. a. p. 149. —</l><l xml:id="m-9a803b00-7c54-46f0-a729-fd1256578bac" facs="#m-ef05204c-37ab-4a22-a531-3447ddb97861" label="lyrics-like">5. Laudâte Dóminum. 8. G. p. 168.</l><l xml:id="m-7e85e0ec-fa92-4844-aa5e-aaa379e08b53" facs="#m-cacf08ee-9088-4c60-9327-fd81db8afe75" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.8</l><l xml:id="m-308d9fd2-d8c4-4a41-b305-20247c6ad507" facs="#m-6955b60d-31b6-4d7b-8a0f-b0917b55c295" label="ambiguous">3.6</l><l xml:id="m-360be37b-a9f5-4b66-9c9b-c86b9ac6b160" facs="#m-1ec677a4-7591-4d02-a32c-4a3e35944ee8" label="lyrics-like">L A- cí-ficus “ vocábi-tur, et thrónus é-jus érit</l><l xml:id="m-249b2eff-b99d-44d3-bbe2-4afbcc7c1751" facs="#m-a9265696-7cb9-4c52-9f6a-3e3acf842511" label="lyrics-like">firmíssimus in perpé-tu-um.</l><l xml:id="m-c658973d-032d-402a-84cd-7ed3763b8d99" facs="#m-f9a84957-b2a5-4ada-9c74-9c5d9f172e22" label="ambiguous">Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-740cc849-d5fc-43d2-8e0a-84b03c43e357" facs="#m-22a58928-a779-483b-ad10-52ca256234ce" label="ambiguous">2. Ant.F—.—</l><l xml:id="m-3b62c9b4-5e15-453b-b785-db0fd8a54059" facs="#m-e7fa276f-f684-48fd-939e-4c6d9d2e785f" label="ambiguous">8. e</l><l xml:id="m-f146f8ff-720c-49aa-99ec-02375a935660" facs="#m-210b486d-b69d-46ed-b965-faef1670829a" label="lyrics-like">Egnum é¬ jus “régnum sempitérnum est, et ómnes</l><l xml:id="m-bbe0c9da-8d12-48fe-9ead-027407e3c2d4" facs="#m-d83521d3-464a-4c9a-a392-fff72e579dc4" label="lyrics-like">ré-ges sérvi-ent é-i et obé-di-ent. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-0225c9e3-728b-4f21-87b3-d259dd9ccf4a" facs="#m-ae1fdf7f-de39-4e10-ae4d-ffef149ad4e3" label="ambiguous">3. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-630d3916-3a2b-4c7d-b445-4a1bc2ed4caa" facs="#m-b00963bf-669c-442b-a191-3002e151be57" label="ambiguous">7.a</l><l xml:id="m-9545cc62-0081-4791-b417-fe76eb77d3f5" facs="#m-c0e1201c-e422-4af3-ab45-c522303aaa6a" label="lyrics-like">Cce vir Ori-ens“ nómen é-jus: sedébit et domi¬</l><l xml:id="m-63226fa0-50a0-4880-9eac-ce28dbb75e18" facs="#m-3bbe2366-1eb9-4e06-9c2c-73ed516d9832" label="ambiguous">Q</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
